   "source": [
    "## Evaluasi Model pada Data Validation\n",
    "`evaluate_model()` menjalankan evaluasi resmi Ultralytics pada split tertentu dan mengembalikan objek metrik berisi mAP50, mAP50-95, Precision, dan Recall."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "67d9dd4f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def evaluate_model(model: YOLO, cfg: Config, split: str):\n",
    "    metrics = model.val(\n",
    "        data=str(cfg.yolo_out / \"data.yaml\"), split=split, imgsz=cfg.train_imgsz\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "metrics = evaluate_model(best_model, CFG, split=\"val\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"mAP50 :\", metrics.box.map50)\n",
    "print(\"mAP50-95 :\", metrics.box.map)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "25e014a1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Evaluasi Akhir pada Data Test\n",
    "Evaluasi final pada split `test` (data yang sama sekali tidak dilihat selama training/validasi)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9e6a89fd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def compute_f1(precision: float, recall: float) -> float:\n",
    "    if precision + recall > 0:\n",
    "        return 2 * precision * recall / (precision + recall)\n",
    "    return 0\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "final_metrics = evaluate_model(best_model, CFG, split=\"test\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Test mAP50 :\", final_metrics.box.map50)\n",
    "print(\"Test mAP50-95 :\", final_metrics.box.map)\n",
    "\n",
    "test_precision = final_metrics.box.mp\n",
    "test_recall = final_metrics.box.mr\n",
    "test_f1 = compute_f1(test_precision, test_recall)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Test Precision :\", test_precision)\n",
    "print(\"Test Recall    :\", test_recall)\n",
    "print(\"Test F1-score  :\", test_f1)"
   ]
  }
